		<p>To stop charging while charging with AC charger, DC charger or portable charger, do the following procedure.</p>
		<ol id="e01371">
			<li>
				<p>Press near the left edge of the charging door.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Press and hold the charging button for 2 seconds within 15 seconds after unlocking the doors.</p>
			</li>
		</ol>
	</conbody>
